Package: blockr.ops
Type: Package
Title: Operations Tooling for 'blockr' Boards
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christoph", "Sax", , "christoph@cynkra.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maintenance tooling for a fleet of 'blockr' boards: many of them,
    kept over time, in version control. Read and write board files without the
    'jsonlite' arguments that quietly break deserialization; turn a board into
    the R script that rebuilds it, and check the round trip; count what a board
    holds; and report the defects that accumulate in stored boards. This is
    operator tooling and reads like it. Nothing here is needed to build a board
    in a browser; it is for the point where the boards themselves became the
    artefact you maintain.
